hakra-link css-9nn75v" href="/pages/terms-of-service?jurisdiction=eu">Terms of Service</a></p></li><li class="css-11nrrcx"><p class="chakra-text css-1qh9pim" data-dls-version="2.1"><a target="_self" class="chakra-link css-9nn75v" href="/pages/risk-warnings?jurisdiction=eu">Risk Summary</a></p></li><li class="css-11nrrcx"><p class="chakra-text css-1qh9pim" data-dls-version="2.1"><a target="_self" class="chakra-link css-9nn75v" href="/pages/complaint-process?jurisdiction=eu">Complaints</a></p></li></ul></div><div class="css-1i18t0z"><p class="chakra-text css-imcn0y" data-dls-version="2.1">Company</p><hr aria-orientation="horizontal" class="chakra-divider css-1s1j5a1"/><ul role="list" class="css-4fvaef"><li class="css-11nrrcx"><p class="chakra-text css-1qh9pim" data-dls-version="2.1"><a target="_self" class="chakra-link css-9nn75v" href="https://republic.com/about">About</a></p></li><li class="css-11nrrcx"><p class="chakra-text css-1qh9pim" data-dls-version="2.1"><a target="_self" class="chakra-link css-9nn75v" href="https://republic.com/jobs">Careers</a></p></li><li class="css-11nrrcx"><p class="chakra-text css-1qh9pim" data-dls-version="2.1"><a target="_self" class="chakra-link css-9nn75v" href="/insights/">Blog</a></p></li><li class="css-11nrrcx"><p class="chakra-text css-1qh9pim" data-dls-version="2.1"><a target="_self" class="chakra-link css-9nn75v" href="https://help.republic.com/">Help centre</a></p></li></ul></div></div></div><style data-emotion="css 1wwudhb">.css-1wwudhb{font-weight:var(--chakra-fontWeights-normal);font-size:var(--chakra-fontSizes-sm);line-height:1rem;letter-spacing:var(--chakra-letterSpacings-less-tight);color:var(--chakra-colors-grey-300);}</style><p class="chakra-text css-1wwudhb" data-dls-version="2.1">Investing involves risks, including loss of capital, illiquidity, lack of dividends and dilution, and should be done only as part of a diversified portfolio. Please read the Risk Warnings before investing. Investments should only be made by investors who understand these risks. Tax treatment depends on individual circumstances and is subject to change in future.</p><p class="chakra-text css-1wwudhb" data-dls-version="2.1">Use of the Republic Europe Secondary Market is subject to the <style data-emotion="css 1b7fnd">.css-1b7fnd{transition-property:var(--chakra-transition-property-common);transition-duration:var(--chakra-transition-duration-fast);transition-timing-function:var(--chakra-transition-easing-ease-out);cursor:pointer;outline:2px solid transparent;outline-offset:2px;font-weight:var(--chakra-fontWeights-normal);font-size:var(--chakra-fontSizes-sm);line-height:1rem;letter-spacing:ultraWide;color:var(--chakra-colors-grey-300);-webkit-text-decoration:underline;text-decoration:underline;}.css-1b7fnd:hover,.css-1b7fnd[data-hover]{-webkit-text-decoration:underline;text-decoration:underline;}.css-1b7fnd:focus-visible,.css-1b7fnd[data-focus-visible]{box-shadow:var(--chakra-shadows-outline);}.css-1b7fnd:focus,.css-1b7fnd[data-focus]{box-shadow:var(--chakra-shadows-none);}</style><a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="chakra-link css-1b7fnd" href="https://europe.republic/learn/secondary-market-terms">Secondary Market Terms &amp; Conditions</a>. Note that not all shares will be eligible for the secondary market and, even if they are, the ability to buy and sell shares will depend on demand. It can be difficult to find a buyer or seller, and investors should not assume that an early exit will be available just because a secondary market exists. Share lots are available to investors who have become authorised to invest on the  Republic Europe platform. You should note that share price history is based on information that is provided to us periodically by the relevant businesses and may not be up to date or accurate. The current share price is calculated using the methodology set out <a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="chakra-link css-1b7fnd" href="https://europe.republic/pages/Valuation-and-IRR">here</a>.</p><p class="chakra-text css-1wwudhb" data-dls-version="2.1">This webpage has been approved as a financial promotion by Seedrs Europe Limited and/or Seedrs Limited (each trading as Republic Europe) (&quot;Republic Europe&quot;), which are authorised and regulated respectively by the Central Bank of Ireland and the Financial Conduct Authority in the United Kingdom. It is not intended to be a promotion of any individual investment opportunity and is not an offer to the public. The summary information provided about investment opportunities on this webpage is intended solely to demonstrate the types of investments available on the Republic Europe platform, and any investment decision should be made on the basis of the full campaign. Full campaigns are available to investors who have become authorised to invest on the Republic Europe platform. Investment activities may take place within the Republic of Ireland and/or the United Kingdom, depending on the applicable entity and investor location. Any person resident outside the Republic of Ireland or the United Kingdom should ensure that they are not subject to any local laws or regulations before investing.</p><p class="chakra-text css-1wwudhb" data-dls-version="2.1">Republic Europe does not make investment recommendations to you. No communications from Republic Europe, through this website or any other medium, should be construed as an investment recommendation. Further, nothing on this website shall be considered an offer to sell, or a solicitation of an offer to buy, any security to any person in any jurisdiction to whom or in which such offer, solicitation or sale is unlawful. Republic Europe does not provide legal, financial or tax advice of any kind. If you have any questions with respect to legal, financial or tax matters relevant to your interactions with  Republic Europe, you should consult a professional adviser.</p><p class="chakra-text css-1wwudhb" data-dls-version="2.1">Seedrs Europe Limited (trading as Republic Europe) is regulated by the Central Bank of Ireland. Seedrs Limited (trading as Republic Europe) is authorised and regulated by the Financial Conduct Authority <a target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="chakra-link css-1b7fnd" href="https://register.fca.org.uk/s/firm?id=001b000000NMXovAAH">(Firm Reference Number: 550317)</a>.<br/>© Seedrs Limited 2026. All rights reserved. Republic Europe is a registered European Community trademark (No. 008771537), registered United Kingdom trademark (No. UK00908771537) and registered United States service mark (No. 85423072). Seedrs Europe Limited is a private company limited by shares registered in Ireland (No. 699574), with registered office at 42, Pearse Street, Dublin 2, D02 YX88, Ireland. Seedrs Limited is a limited company registered in England and Wales (No. 06848016), with registered office at Cubo Soho, Ilona Rose House, Manette Street, London W1D 4AL, United Kingdom, VAT No. GB 208 3065 32.<br/>europe.republic.com is a website owned and operated by Seedrs Europe Limited and/or Seedrs Limited (each trading as Republic Europe).</p><style data-emotion="css 2pjxe2">.css-2pjxe2{border:var(--chakra-borders-0);border-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1px;width:100%;border-color:var(--chakra-colors-grey-700);opacity:1;}</style><hr aria-orientation="horizontal" class="chakra-divider css-2pjxe2"/><style data-emotion="css 1ialerq">.css-1ialerq{display:-webkit-box;display:-webkit-flex;display:-ms-flexbox;display:flex;-webkit-flex-direction:row;-ms-flex-direction:row;flex-direction:row;-webkit-align-items:center;-webkit-box-align:center;-ms-flex-align:center;align-items:center;-webkit-box-pack:justify;-webkit-justify-content:space-between;justify-content:space-between;}</style><div class="css-1ialerq"><p class="chakra-text css-1wwudhb" data-dls-version="2.1">Made in LDN/LX/DHK</p><style data-emotion="css 1fb3o3p">.css-1fb3o3p{display:-webkit-box;display:-webkit-flex;display:-ms-flexbox;display:flex;-webkit-flex-direction:row